-- title:
--   In characteristic two the gradient locus of the selected coefficient polynomial has small Krull dimension (OpenAI permanent, cf. Proposition 6.1)
-- statement:
--   **The selected coefficient** (definitions bundle `OAIQWPB000` of this split). For a field $K$, $d$, $\theta \in K^d$ and $q$, $G_\theta(X) = [s^q t^q]\ \mathrm{per}_d(X + sI + tD)$ with $D = \mathrm{diag}(\theta)$ (`Selector.diagonalCoefficient`), a polynomial in the $d^2$ variables $X_{ab}$. The index is $q = \lfloor (d-1)/3 \rfloor$ (`selectorIndex d`), and `sectionSize d` $= \binom{q+2}{2} / 18$ (integer division).
--
--   **The statement.** Let $K$ be an infinite perfect field of characteristic $2$ and $d \ge 128$. Then there is $\theta \in K^d$ such that the quotient of $K[X_{ab}]$ by the ideal generated by all partial derivatives $\partial G_\theta / \partial X_{ab}$ has Krull dimension at most $d^2 - \texttt{sectionSize}\ d$.
--
--   So the gradient locus of $G_\theta$ has codimension at least `sectionSize d`; this is the effective form of the paper's Proposition 6.1 (gradient codimension) used in the proof.
--
--   Lean: `OAI.PermanentBorder.exists_effective_critical_bound`, OpenAI's theorem of that name (in `lean/OAI/Algebra/Determinantal/Main.lean`).
-- source:
--   OpenAI, A cubic lower bound for border determinantal complexity of the permanent, OpenAI Math Release, September 24, 2026, https://github.com/openai/math (result family 108; paper: https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/A-cubic-lower-bound-for-border-determinantal-complexity-of-the-permanent-September-24-2026/A-cubic-lower-bound-for-border-determinantal-complexity-of-the-permanent-September-24-2026.pdf, cf. Proposition 6.1; Apache License 2.0); Lean: https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/OAI/Algebra/Determinantal/Main.lean (declaration OAI.PermanentBorder.exists_effective_critical_bound)

import Mathlib
import Definitions.Def_PermanentCubic
import Definitions.Def_OAIQWPB000

section

set_option linter.all false
set_option linter.unusedVariables false
set_option linter.unusedTactic false
set_option linter.unreachableTactic false

namespace OAI

namespace PermanentBorder
open Parameters EffectiveParameters SpectralDimension MvPolynomial

theorem exists_effective_critical_bound {K : Type} [Field K] [Infinite K]
    [CharP K 2] [PerfectRing K 2] {d : ℕ} (hd : 128 ≤ d) :
    ∃ θ : Fin d → K,
      ringKrullDim (MvPolynomial (Variables d) K ⧸
        Ideal.span (Set.range (fun i => pderiv i
          (Selector.diagonalCoefficient
            (Matrix.of fun a b => (X (a,b) : MvPolynomial (Variables d) K))
            (fun i => C (θ i)) (selectorIndex d))))) ≤
        ((d^2-sectionSize d : ℕ) : WithBot ℕ∞) := by
  sorry

end PermanentBorder

end OAI
end
